      "requirement": "Exactlythreeenclosuregroups:1HaughtonattributedcriticismwithDarwinparenthetical(ieLyells&yours)andQED;2Darwinauthorialcovernoteannouncinguncorrectedreversionexpansion,theEXPANDEDMANUSCRIPTISABSENT;3Darwinsecondpostscriptreturningjust-readGrayProceedingsreport,notentireJapanmemoir. PreservequotedHaughtonvoiceinsideDarwincommunicationandexcludeeditorialh2/footnotemarkers. Do notexportamissingMSorGraypaperasthoughincluded.",
